OL,3,AEx-congressman George Santos banned
OL,4,Afrom betting platform for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrediction-market operator Kalshi has
OL,7,Fpermanently barred former US
OL,8,Fcongressman George Santos from trading
OL,9,Fon its platform.
OL,11,FThe company alleged that Santos, who
OL,12,Fwas expelled from Congress following a
OL,13,Fseries of fraud and identity-theft
OL,14,Fcharges, placed bets in February
OL,15,Frelated to his own attendance at US
OL,16,FPresident Donald Trump's State of the
OL,17,FUnion address, according to a notice of
OL,18,Fdisciplinary action.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
