OL,3,AEx-congressman George Santos banned
OL,4,Afrom betting platform for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FKalshi said its compliance team
OL,7,Fconcluded his activity showed signs of
OL,8,Finsider dealing, prompting the lifetime
OL,9,Fban. It said it was acting
OL,10,Findependently without waiting for
OL,11,Fexternal enforcement action.
OL,13,FSantos on X thanked Kalshi for the ban
OL,14,Fand said "Let's see how much longer you
OL,15,Fguys are around for".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
